## Source
Path B UX dry-run (0152), severity: **Low**

## Context
`integration.md` step 2 says "Add this line to your `AGENTS.md` (or equivalent
agent-visible file)." It gives no guidance for a project that has neither
`AGENTS.md` nor an obvious equivalent. The dry-run agent added it to `README.md`
as a guess — reasonable but inconsistent across projects.

## Fix
Add one sentence to step 2:
"If your project has no `AGENTS.md`, create one at the project root; or add the
line to `CLAUDE.md`, `README.md`, or whichever file your agent picks up at
session start."

## Exit criteria
- [ ] `integration.md` step 2 names the fallback priority explicitly
